# Paths the safe-bin/rm wrapper (.claude/cfn-scripts/safe-bin/rm) refuses to delete,
# on top of its built-in rules (/, top-level dirs, /mnt/<x>, $HOME and its direct
# children, git repo roots directly under ~/projects).
# One absolute or ~/ path per line; # starts a comment. Deleting a listed path or
# any parent of one is refused. Personal additions: ~/.config/cfn-rm-protect.conf
